# home-from-picker -- return-nav from the dense unit picker BACK to home.
# [stol:ui-planner-cov-starts] Start context(unit_picker_dense) (reached by
# nav_home_to_unit_picker_dense) forces A* to route back via
# nav_unit_picker_dense_to_home. The SETUP route home->picker is driven first at
# --run but is NOT measured.
# start: context(unit_picker_dense)
context(home)
